  "scope": [
    "exact seven fixed groups, thirty-nine K-A rules, complete single coverage and source ordering",
    "universal/family/program mode fold annotations, ten dynamic inputs and source-hash program binding only in per-program mode",
    "zero-limit tooling refusal; positive size policy and emitted block count min(limit,7), with surplus groups sent to generic dispatch",
    "dense conservative successor graph except terminal publish; runtime calls keep their self edge, do not unroll and retain dynamic frame checks",
    "complete-state projection supplied explicitly to dynamic pre-step dispatch, publication/zero-fuel priority and generic fallback",
    "matching record retains exact supplied whole-state transition; mismatch refuses; terminal state does not step",
    "static partition ignores mode/runtime values; static annotation differences are modeled separately"
  ],
  "remainingObligations": [
    "Prove exact projection of actual Rust Snapshot/control/frames/environment into DispatchInput, pending predicate and full-state machine step. Tags and constructors alone establish no Rust refinement.",
    "Prove Rust BTreeMap assignment, prefix selection, ascending generic-rule sorting and exact JSON group data correspond to these definitions for every limit and mode.",
    "Prove executeBoundary/checkedRecord correspondence, loop termination/cap handling, no-progress failure, complete ordered records, state continuity, source-stop maps, prefix work and width-one slice serialization.",
    "Instantiate CompilerResidualization.RecordProduced and ResidualExecution using the actual implementation. Stream equality and annotations alone do not establish this.",
    "Prove canonical JSON/sha256 identity and raw-source hash encoding. The implemented per-program token hashes raw source bytes; no canonical ProgramImage or collision/injectivity claim is made.",
    "The source labels source occurrences as occ:<K-rule-line>, not distinct source AST locations; prove any stronger source-occurrence contract separately.",
    "Positive size limits alter a seven-group prefix, with no minimum specialization benefit; no size/cost/performance improvement is asserted.",
    "Read committed primary-scenario U033 PASS traces and matching run records; prove binary/source reproducibility and broader semantics separately. The later run records old HEAD d7 with uncommitted CLI edits, not a reproducible build receipt.",
    "No same-fuel A/B equivalence, B/C6/financial residualization, circuit/native/stock-verifier/ledger acceptance follows."
  ],
